WEBVTT

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:20.870
Ready!

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:29.160
Monitor looks good. Let's get started.

00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:35.720
Initiating Mark Nicht disassembly Plan D.

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:06.420
Its pain perception was supposed to be cut off.

00:01:12.650 --> 00:01:15.170
I'm going to rip out

00:01:15.540 --> 00:01:16.680
your heart!

00:01:36.020 --> 00:01:39.150
Who would have thought
the child of nonexistence

00:01:39.150 --> 00:01:41.210
would refuse to return to nothingness?

00:03:13.830 --> 00:03:16.960
New pilot candidate number 1: Mikagami Mimika.

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:20.480
Physical potential: special A++.

00:03:20.480 --> 00:03:22.110
Her assimilation-phenomenon tolerance

00:03:22.110 --> 00:03:22.970
ranks at the top.

00:03:23.300 --> 00:03:27.360
In terms of physical ability, she's the pilot
course's first M1-level candidate.

00:03:27.360 --> 00:03:29.890
That means she's on your level, Kazuki.

00:03:30.590 --> 00:03:31.810
Wow.

00:03:31.810 --> 00:03:32.850
Candidate number 2:

00:03:32.850 --> 00:03:34.310
Mikado Reo.

00:03:34.310 --> 00:03:35.290
Physical: A.

00:03:35.290 --> 00:03:37.360
Martial arts ability: special A++.

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:40.360
His skill level puts even tactical units to shame.

00:03:42.240 --> 00:03:45.070
He might even be able to beat you, Kazuki.

00:03:45.070 --> 00:03:45.770
Hmm...

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:48.990
Candidate number 3: Kaburagi Sui.

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:50.210
Physical: B.

00:03:50.210 --> 00:03:51.130
Skill: A.

00:03:51.130 --> 00:03:54.420
Situational judgment: special A++.

00:03:59.350 --> 00:04:02.640
Reasoning, concentration,
and mental potential are

00:04:02.640 --> 00:04:04.800
the highest in the history of our pilots.

00:04:04.800 --> 00:04:07.140
His intelligence is on Soushi's level.

00:04:07.140 --> 00:04:10.370
He's the successor to the
Siegfried system, after all.

00:04:10.370 --> 00:04:12.190
How did the factor influence them?

00:04:12.190 --> 00:04:15.510
The genetic modification to boost
their survival probability

00:04:15.510 --> 00:04:17.650
is manifesting normally.

00:04:18.180 --> 00:04:20.330
We see no chance of them losing their balance

00:04:20.330 --> 00:04:23.260
of mind and body due to failure to
comprehend their own abilities.

00:04:23.260 --> 00:04:27.060
Improving their abilities is up to
their own willpower and effort.

00:04:27.060 --> 00:04:28.490
They're true geniuses.

00:04:28.990 --> 00:04:32.500
So, Kazuki, as a former ace, what do you think?

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:34.060
Huh? Uh...

00:04:34.620 --> 00:04:36.020
Are they good friends?

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:39.090
They spend a fair amount of time together.

00:04:39.090 --> 00:04:40.420
Sounds good to me, then.

00:04:40.750 --> 00:04:41.920
What sounds good?

00:04:42.280 --> 00:04:44.630
He's probably thinking of their teamwork.

00:04:44.630 --> 00:04:46.640
When we see them in action, we'll learn that.

00:04:46.640 --> 00:04:48.510
Can they begin immediately?

00:04:48.860 --> 00:04:50.610
Right away.

00:04:51.060 --> 00:04:52.980
You're coming with me, Kazuki.

00:04:53.230 --> 00:04:53.980
Huh?

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:58.610
We're going to do everything we can
to ensure they return home safely.

00:04:58.890 --> 00:05:00.980
I'll handle their medical checkups.

00:05:01.250 --> 00:05:03.220
Thanks, Kenji-kun.

00:05:03.710 --> 00:05:06.860
Kaname-sensei and Sakura-kun,
take care of the pilots.

00:05:06.860 --> 00:05:09.740
I vow to give them our best backup.

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:16.000
Starting today, you three are this island's shield.

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:17.750
As well as the sword to defeat its enemies.

00:05:18.100 --> 00:05:19.550
Are you ready for that?

00:05:19.550 --> 00:05:20.250
Yes!

00:05:20.620 --> 00:05:23.050
Improved model number 3, Nothung model,

00:05:23.050 --> 00:05:27.890
Double Ace, based on Marks Elf, Sechs, and Funf.

00:05:28.100 --> 00:05:29.640
These are your mechs.

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:31.320
Our mechs...

00:05:31.320 --> 00:05:32.850
What are their names?

00:05:32.850 --> 00:05:35.060
I want a cool name!

00:05:37.290 --> 00:05:39.530
They're only provisional, but I'll tell you.

00:05:39.530 --> 00:05:42.190
The Mark Elf mod is Féth Fíada.

00:05:43.190 --> 00:05:46.010
The Mark Sechs mod is Fragarach.

00:05:46.010 --> 00:05:48.480
The Mark Funf mod is Lia Fáil.

00:05:48.480 --> 00:05:51.780
All the names come from my homeland, Ireland.

00:05:51.780 --> 00:05:53.040
H-Huh?

00:05:53.530 --> 00:05:54.910
Those are hard to say...

00:05:54.910 --> 00:05:56.500
I'd prefer different names!

00:05:57.710 --> 00:06:00.280
You guys, they're just provisional.

00:06:00.280 --> 00:06:03.360
I'm sure Canon-sensei will give
them much better names.

00:06:03.360 --> 00:06:04.590
You will?

00:06:05.660 --> 00:06:06.760
Oh, dear.

00:06:06.760 --> 00:06:08.620
O-Of course!

00:06:08.620 --> 00:06:10.610
Anything else?

00:06:10.610 --> 00:06:12.370
I want mine to be pink!

00:06:12.370 --> 00:06:13.430
What?

00:06:13.430 --> 00:06:15.660
I'm not big on black, either...

00:06:15.660 --> 00:06:19.410
Thinking of the mech as one's
self fosters a sense of unity.

00:06:19.410 --> 00:06:21.940
Then names and colors are important, right?

00:06:21.940 --> 00:06:24.480
Th-That's...

00:06:24.480 --> 00:06:26.110
exactly right.

00:06:26.110 --> 00:06:27.810
We'll consider your requests.

00:06:27.810 --> 00:06:31.200
First, we'll have you learn
more about the mechs.

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:32.110
Yes, ma'am.

00:06:33.470 --> 00:06:37.270
What makes a Fafner unique is that
the pilot doesn't need to control it.

00:06:37.270 --> 00:06:40.910
The Nibelung System connects
the mech to its pilot,

00:06:40.910 --> 00:06:42.660
who uses thought to make it move.

00:06:42.660 --> 00:06:43.920
That's right. However...

00:06:43.920 --> 00:06:49.300
However, the core inside the mech causes
an assimilation phenomenon in the pilot.

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:53.720
And because pain perception is important
to human athletic ability,

00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:56.310
the pilot feels any damage
the mech takes as pain.

00:06:56.310 --> 00:06:57.890
Why, yes. That's perfect.

00:06:57.890 --> 00:06:59.920
Th-That's right.

00:06:59.920 --> 00:07:01.340
There's one more important thing—

00:07:01.340 --> 00:07:03.310
Some pilots may experience
a change in mental state,

00:07:03.550 --> 00:07:06.000
resulting in a state of altered consciousness.

00:07:07.400 --> 00:07:08.610
Get a clue.

00:07:08.610 --> 00:07:10.320
You talk too much, Sui-chan.

00:07:11.080 --> 00:07:12.780
Getting to work, I see.

00:07:14.020 --> 00:07:16.160
Kazuki, why are you here?

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:17.900
Wh-Why?

00:07:17.900 --> 00:07:22.490
This former ace pilot is here
to give you a pep talk!

00:07:22.490 --> 00:07:24.520
Uh, no, I don't really...

00:07:24.520 --> 00:07:25.830
Say something!

00:07:25.830 --> 00:07:27.460
Now, now, Sakura...

00:07:33.000 --> 00:07:36.260
Listen to what the others say, you three.

00:07:36.870 --> 00:07:39.240
Well, if you don't like the order,
you don't have to listen—

00:07:39.240 --> 00:07:40.340
Yes, they do!

00:07:40.340 --> 00:07:41.470
Okay, okay.

00:07:42.610 --> 00:07:46.410
You think differently when you're
fighting than when you're not.

00:07:46.930 --> 00:07:48.810
You'll get many orders you don't agree with.

00:07:49.250 --> 00:07:53.910
But there's no one who thinks it
wouldn't matter if we lost you.

00:07:54.550 --> 00:07:56.140
Everyone has faith in you.

00:07:56.560 --> 00:07:59.460
As you fight, I want you to
have faith in them, too.

00:07:59.460 --> 00:08:00.160
Right!

00:08:01.370 --> 00:08:05.130
Well, I guess it's okay if
you don't have faith in—

00:08:06.650 --> 00:08:08.460
All right, let's get started!

00:08:16.870 --> 00:08:19.180
We have to walk out naked?

00:08:21.400 --> 00:08:22.350
No!

00:08:22.350 --> 00:08:24.310
Can you see me?

00:08:24.310 --> 00:08:27.190
We're not looking. Just walk straight.

00:08:28.760 --> 00:08:31.150
The pilot suit alleviates the
impact of the connection

00:08:31.680 --> 00:08:34.250
and the assimilation phenomenon...

00:08:36.700 --> 00:08:38.990
I don't think this is right.

00:08:43.100 --> 00:08:44.000
Okay.

00:08:50.050 --> 00:08:51.240
It reeks of sweat!

00:08:59.580 --> 00:09:00.740
Kaburagi...

00:09:01.210 --> 00:09:03.350
You don't have it on right.

00:09:03.580 --> 00:09:05.850
Huh? Rina-senpai?

00:09:06.310 --> 00:09:07.780
Ow! Ow! Ow!

00:09:08.680 --> 00:09:10.710
You put it on like this!

00:09:11.690 --> 00:09:12.900
Got it?

00:09:13.690 --> 00:09:16.200
Sorry! Sorry! Sorry!

00:09:25.890 --> 00:09:27.250
Everyone's here.

00:09:27.610 --> 00:09:29.380
Hello, Hiroto-senpai!

00:09:29.720 --> 00:09:32.130
Hey. Glad to have you, third generation.

00:09:32.350 --> 00:09:35.130
Putting on that helmet makes
you feel brave, huh?

00:09:35.130 --> 00:09:37.050
Y-Yeah.

00:09:39.190 --> 00:09:41.260
Okay, ready to start?

00:09:51.330 --> 00:09:53.950
Hardly any fish in the ocean here.

00:09:53.950 --> 00:09:55.150
Yuuko-san!

00:09:55.150 --> 00:09:56.360
Huh?

00:09:56.610 --> 00:09:58.740
Commander Makabe and Toumi-sensei are here.

00:10:09.300 --> 00:10:11.860
Practical training has already begun.

00:10:14.740 --> 00:10:15.720
But...

00:10:16.430 --> 00:10:19.050
But Mimika is my treasure!

00:10:19.490 --> 00:10:22.150
I lost my homeland, and she's all I have.

00:10:22.150 --> 00:10:25.060
Yuuko-san, I understand how you feel.

00:10:25.490 --> 00:10:29.610
I heard the survival rate in the
war was the highest in history.

00:10:30.020 --> 00:10:32.120
Last time, they all came back safe!

00:10:32.120 --> 00:10:33.820
She'll be fine for sure, right?

00:10:34.850 --> 00:10:36.450
In battle, nothing is certain.

00:10:37.060 --> 00:10:39.230
But we'll support her to the best of our ability.

00:10:39.230 --> 00:10:41.070
It just isn't right.

00:10:41.330 --> 00:10:43.350
Making children protect us...

00:10:46.600 --> 00:10:50.020
Ready? You are the Fafners,
and the Fafners are you.

00:10:50.020 --> 00:10:51.720
Call each other by your mechs' names.

00:10:51.720 --> 00:10:52.870
What were they?

00:10:52.870 --> 00:10:55.990
Féth Fíada, Fragarach, and Lia Fáil.

00:10:55.990 --> 00:10:58.590
We're not using those weird names, are we?

00:10:58.590 --> 00:11:02.680
That's strange... Canon-senpai
said they were all set.

00:11:02.680 --> 00:11:03.700
Oh, dear.

00:11:03.700 --> 00:11:06.470
Just watch... I'll think of something
to make them happy.

00:11:06.470 --> 00:11:07.650
Going at it, I see.

00:11:07.650 --> 00:11:10.240
Welcome back. I saw the data.

00:11:10.240 --> 00:11:11.480
It's awful.

00:11:11.890 --> 00:11:13.880
Having trouble dismantling it?

00:11:13.880 --> 00:11:15.340
I'll give it some more thought.

00:11:15.890 --> 00:11:17.610
If we get rid of Nicht,

00:11:17.610 --> 00:11:20.570
Sein's resonance will stop, and it can be piloted.

00:11:20.570 --> 00:11:23.160
We've already decided to dispose of Sein.

00:11:23.160 --> 00:11:25.950
In and of itself, it's our most powerful
mech, and should be preserved.

00:11:26.940 --> 00:11:29.540
It tried to devour Kazuki! It's a monster!

00:11:30.450 --> 00:11:33.170
That's what a Fafner does, Canon.

00:11:43.170 --> 00:11:45.540
Commander Makabe, are you
giving the order to attack?

00:11:46.660 --> 00:11:49.270
Not to you, Kaburagi.

00:11:53.410 --> 00:11:56.720
Seems like the rumors about
Uosada-san have died down.

00:11:56.720 --> 00:12:00.240
To think he got himself a gorgeous
wife like Shao-san...

00:12:00.240 --> 00:12:02.610
I heard they met in Alvis.

00:12:04.180 --> 00:12:05.120
Welco—

00:12:10.030 --> 00:12:12.550
We'll go anywhere we're ordered to.

00:12:13.210 --> 00:12:16.160
Like our daughter who went to
battle and never came home...

00:12:18.060 --> 00:12:21.690
Kanae-san, there is no way for us to win.

00:12:22.200 --> 00:12:23.550
Not without the Fafners.

00:12:23.550 --> 00:12:27.180
Captain Kaname fought with conventional
weaponry and died.

00:12:27.410 --> 00:12:30.510
We have continued to undergo training.

00:12:30.510 --> 00:12:32.670
It's your son who will fight.

00:12:33.510 --> 00:12:37.110
I need you to support Sui-kun, Kaburagi.

00:12:38.690 --> 00:12:42.550
Mikadoya

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:56.210
Victory

00:13:04.170 --> 00:13:07.410
No matter how many times we
do this, it's always difficult.

00:13:08.750 --> 00:13:11.340
I'm grateful to you, Chizuru-san.

00:13:13.030 --> 00:13:15.310
I only send soldiers into battle.

00:13:16.250 --> 00:13:19.230
Without you, none would have returned alive.

00:13:19.750 --> 00:13:20.460
Not at all.

00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:28.320
I took part in their development, as well.

00:13:29.010 --> 00:13:31.890
We used all the technology
that was said to be taboo,

00:13:31.890 --> 00:13:34.420
even manipulating children's genes...

00:13:36.370 --> 00:13:37.330
And I got used to it.

00:13:38.550 --> 00:13:40.490
It's not your fault.

00:13:43.100 --> 00:13:46.170
Using undeveloped brains to power weaponry...

00:13:47.020 --> 00:13:49.340
I never thought such dangerous,
life-shortening technology

00:13:49.600 --> 00:13:51.620
would be used throughout the world.

00:13:53.120 --> 00:13:56.770
The boy in the Human Army called Bartland...

00:13:57.400 --> 00:13:58.850
How is he?

00:13:58.850 --> 00:14:02.100
He's very serious and driven to fulfill his duty.

00:14:03.810 --> 00:14:05.860
The resemblance is so strong, it's scary.

00:14:06.580 --> 00:14:08.390
He's just like him when he was young.

00:14:19.550 --> 00:14:23.340
Emery and Miwa gave me an ideal
that differs from my father's.

00:14:23.710 --> 00:14:27.710
Miwa's mother, Yumiko-san, is truly
the holy mother in my eyes!

00:14:27.710 --> 00:14:31.340
Oh, please, you're exaggerating...

00:14:31.770 --> 00:14:32.840
I mean it.

00:14:33.330 --> 00:14:37.060
I can't believe you and Michio were together.

00:14:37.330 --> 00:14:39.290
You know my daddy?

00:14:39.290 --> 00:14:40.230
Of course.

00:14:40.660 --> 00:14:41.780
Triple Six.

00:14:42.220 --> 00:14:46.120
The king of beasts, who destroyed the enemy,
and brought victory to our side.

00:14:46.120 --> 00:14:47.820
He was the greatest Fafner pilot.

00:14:48.920 --> 00:14:50.200
Tell me more!

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:54.100
He's a great guy!

00:14:54.100 --> 00:14:55.850
Not to mention great-looking!

00:14:55.850 --> 00:14:58.600
Sis, that has nothing to do with anything.

00:15:07.460 --> 00:15:10.180
Minashiro... Tsubaki?

00:15:11.110 --> 00:15:15.310
How will you bless the world?

00:15:17.530 --> 00:15:18.490
Kazuki.

00:15:19.630 --> 00:15:20.940
You're home?

00:15:20.940 --> 00:15:24.010
Y-Yeah. Welcome back.

00:15:26.680 --> 00:15:28.070
You have a way to go.

00:15:29.430 --> 00:15:31.820
You were the same, weren't you?

00:15:32.380 --> 00:15:34.050
Mine don't get distorted anymore.

00:15:36.340 --> 00:15:39.900
It isn't as if I can't pilot one at all now.

00:15:41.940 --> 00:15:45.150
If you need me, you can use me!

00:15:47.080 --> 00:15:48.290
I'll remember that...

00:15:49.140 --> 00:15:53.730
But for now, show the pilots following
in your footsteps that there's a way

00:15:54.220 --> 00:15:56.010
to avoid losing your heart and life to war.

00:16:03.270 --> 00:16:05.850
Man, that really hurt!

00:16:05.850 --> 00:16:08.270
Seri and Hiroto should really tone it down a little!

00:16:08.680 --> 00:16:11.050
I always have to play the weak one...

00:16:11.050 --> 00:16:12.900
Thanks for playing the one who loses.

00:16:13.260 --> 00:16:15.800
That should give those guys some courage.

00:16:15.800 --> 00:16:18.450
With more battle-ready forces, we can
head to the outside world.

00:16:20.100 --> 00:16:23.180
I'm also thinking of applying
for the expeditionary force.

00:16:23.180 --> 00:16:24.370
What are you saying?

00:16:31.090 --> 00:16:32.470
Here. Protective charms.

00:16:32.470 --> 00:16:33.710
Yay!

00:16:33.710 --> 00:16:35.260
Thank you!

00:16:35.260 --> 00:16:37.930
My older sister got the same one.

00:16:38.200 --> 00:16:41.020
When she was in Plan L.
Really takes me back...

00:16:41.610 --> 00:16:42.550
I see...

00:16:52.730 --> 00:16:54.530
Did you give them the charms?

00:16:54.840 --> 00:16:55.490
Yes.

00:16:56.410 --> 00:16:58.130
They were really happy.

00:16:58.130 --> 00:17:00.660
Her brother will take to the battlefield, too?

00:17:02.010 --> 00:17:05.080
I'd rather not have to hang
any more pictures here...

00:17:07.990 --> 00:17:09.290
Pink?

00:17:09.680 --> 00:17:11.540
The pilot requested it.

00:17:12.680 --> 00:17:14.850
Guess I'll have to recoat it...

00:17:14.850 --> 00:17:15.780
Where's Canon?

00:17:18.190 --> 00:17:20.760
Doing her best to meet their expectations.

00:17:25.620 --> 00:17:26.770
It's no use...

00:17:26.770 --> 00:17:28.470
Nishio Shop

00:17:28.470 --> 00:17:28.790
Why do you want to leave the island?!
Nishio Shop

00:17:28.790 --> 00:17:30.900
Why do you want to leave the island?!

00:17:31.210 --> 00:17:34.700
Commander Makabe thinks there's
merit in their proposal.

00:17:34.700 --> 00:17:36.910
That's why he moved up the new pilots' training.

00:17:36.910 --> 00:17:38.920
So you trust the Human Army?

00:17:38.920 --> 00:17:40.990
They attack people without a second thought!

00:17:41.260 --> 00:17:44.170
The ones here now have nothing against us.

00:17:44.170 --> 00:17:45.380
I wonder about that.

00:17:45.990 --> 00:17:48.580
You know Miwa-chan is special, don't you?

00:17:49.060 --> 00:17:51.690
She might really save the world.

00:17:51.690 --> 00:17:54.340
But... We don't know that!

00:17:54.600 --> 00:17:57.100
I'm sure the expeditionary force will come to be.

00:17:57.100 --> 00:18:00.160
Even Toumi-senpai intends to go,
to protect Miwa-chan.

00:18:00.160 --> 00:18:02.330
You just want to go with Toumi-senpai, don't you?

00:18:02.330 --> 00:18:03.600
N-No!

00:18:04.050 --> 00:18:06.280
I want to learn about the outside world!

00:18:06.280 --> 00:18:07.670
Idiot.

00:18:07.670 --> 00:18:09.830
Say something to him, Grandma.

00:18:13.110 --> 00:18:18.260
You twins have certainly grown
to think quite differently.

00:18:19.240 --> 00:18:21.130
Humans are not soft.

00:18:21.130 --> 00:18:23.990
At times, they are more frightening than the enemy.

00:18:23.990 --> 00:18:26.500
Are you prepared to learn that?

00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:27.080
Yes.

00:18:29.190 --> 00:18:32.300
You're no longer a child. Decide for yourself.

00:18:32.730 --> 00:18:33.750
Thanks!

00:18:35.090 --> 00:18:37.260
Well, I'm totally against this!

00:18:44.330 --> 00:18:45.180
All right!

00:18:47.760 --> 00:18:50.440
Mimika, come eat!

00:18:51.050 --> 00:18:53.020
Wow!

00:18:53.020 --> 00:18:55.610
Starting today, you're this world's divine protector.

00:18:55.610 --> 00:18:58.000
Eat plenty and get your strength up.

00:18:58.000 --> 00:18:59.360
Okay!

00:19:00.650 --> 00:19:02.150
Let's eat!

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:14.880
Mikadoya

00:19:22.820 --> 00:19:24.450
Reo, can I see you?

00:19:25.770 --> 00:19:27.810
J-Just a second!

00:19:28.530 --> 00:19:32.310
A long time ago, I studied engineering
in a country called Belgium.

00:19:32.700 --> 00:19:36.460
That's where I met your mom,
who earned a living making sweets.

00:19:36.460 --> 00:19:40.290
It was right around when they started
setting up their base at the North Pole.

00:19:40.290 --> 00:19:42.700
I'm kinda busy...

00:19:47.050 --> 00:19:49.830
It's a country famous for the
lion on its coat of arms.

00:19:50.380 --> 00:19:52.810
That was the inspiration for your name.

00:19:52.810 --> 00:19:56.340
Your mom hoped you would grow strong.

00:19:57.960 --> 00:20:00.840
This belonged to my grandfather. Want it?

00:20:02.490 --> 00:20:04.340
Yeah... Is it real?

00:20:06.250 --> 00:20:07.350
It's real.

00:20:07.350 --> 00:20:09.750
Kaname-sensei taught you
how to use one, right?

00:20:09.750 --> 00:20:10.300
Yes.

00:20:11.370 --> 00:20:14.950
You are a samurai with a lion's soul.

00:20:15.370 --> 00:20:17.610
Show the Festum that.

00:20:18.730 --> 00:20:19.350
Okay!

00:20:27.110 --> 00:20:28.120
Um...

00:20:29.800 --> 00:20:31.870
Th-Thank you!

00:20:47.710 --> 00:20:48.820
What are you doing?

00:20:49.260 --> 00:20:51.520
What are you doing with your sister's hair?

00:20:51.810 --> 00:20:53.770
Mom... I...

00:20:57.230 --> 00:20:59.000
What are you thinking?

00:20:59.480 --> 00:21:01.240
Never touch it again!

00:21:02.130 --> 00:21:02.870
What happened?

00:21:07.960 --> 00:21:09.080
Kanae...

00:21:13.080 --> 00:21:15.750
I was supposed to go...

00:21:16.650 --> 00:21:18.750
Why was he the only one?

00:21:19.420 --> 00:21:23.880
Mom, I've become a pilot.

00:21:27.480 --> 00:21:31.140
I'll protect you and Dad.

00:21:31.450 --> 00:21:34.160
I'll protect this island, like my sister did.

00:21:35.830 --> 00:21:38.650
Sui, go on to your room.

00:21:41.270 --> 00:21:44.440
Goodnight, Dad... Mom.

00:21:48.030 --> 00:21:50.030
I will now reveal the mechs' code names.

00:21:50.290 --> 00:21:52.790
The Sechs mod is Amaterasu.

00:21:53.100 --> 00:21:55.540
The Elf mod is Susanoo.

00:21:55.810 --> 00:21:58.290
The Funf mod is Tsukuyomi.

00:21:58.580 --> 00:22:00.170
H-How's that?

00:22:00.170 --> 00:22:00.650
I can remember those!

00:22:00.650 --> 00:22:02.000
Cool!

00:22:02.000 --> 00:22:03.210
Really?

00:22:03.210 --> 00:22:05.800
Thank you, Canon-sensei.

00:22:06.110 --> 00:22:07.920
It's no big deal.

00:22:07.920 --> 00:22:10.930
Make any requests you want now.

00:22:13.560 --> 00:22:15.180
While you can...

00:22:15.940 --> 00:22:19.270
The age when we could inherit
only peace has passed.

00:22:28.070 --> 00:22:29.400
You will soon learn that,

00:22:30.070 --> 00:22:32.710
once a battle has begun,

00:22:32.710 --> 00:22:35.040
it will continue across generations.

00:22:42.650 --> 00:22:46.010
You will know neither why it
begins nor when it will end.

00:22:47.140 --> 00:22:50.390
You have inherited the fight to live for today.

00:24:22.740 --> 00:24:25.390
<i>Fafner in the Azure: Exodus</i>, episode 5:

00:24:25.390 --> 00:24:26.680
To a New World.
